# Shelf repair reaches a quiet pass (held-out spec FB-0255).
# expect: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 2 3
list 2 1 4 3 6 5 7 end let shelf
6 let max-passes
0 let passes
0 let swaps

max-passes 0 gt if
  begin
    0 let pass-swaps
    0 shelf len 1 sub range each
      let i
      shelf i at let left
      shelf i 1 add at let right
      left right gt if
        shelf i right put i 1 add left put let shelf
        pass-swaps 1 add let pass-swaps
        swaps 1 add let swaps
      then
    end
    passes 1 add let passes
    pass-swaps 0 eq passes max-passes ge or
  until
then

shelf string
passes
swaps
